# Grandfathered for create-index-without-concurrently. Already shipped to main
# (certificates 非表示フラグ機能, 2026-06-19) — the file is frozen history.
# idx_certs_tenant_hidden_created is created on the EXISTING `certificates`
# table, so it cannot use the new-empty-table exception; and CONCURRENTLY is
# impractical here because Supabase wraps each migration file in a transaction
# (see the rule note in scripts/lint-migrations.js — CONCURRENTLY cannot run
# inside a transaction). The one-time write lock to build the index is bounded
# and was accepted at ship time. Rationale: docs/operations/zero-downtime-migrations.md.
20260619000000_certificates_hidden.sql

# Allowlisted for create-index-without-concurrently. idx_tenants_email_inbound_token
# is a partial UNIQUE index on the EXISTING `tenants` table (メール予約取り込みの
# 受信トークンをクロステナントで一意に保つため)。new-empty-table exception is not
# applicable; CONCURRENTLY cannot run inside Supabase's per-file transaction. `tenants`
# is a small table, so the one-time write lock to build the index is bounded and
# accepted at ship time. Rationale: docs/operations/zero-downtime-migrations.md.
20260708000002_email_inbound.sql

# Allowlisted for create-index-without-concurrently. idx_customer_messages_thread_by_email
# is a partial index on the EXISTING `customer_messages` table (メール受信のスレッドキー
# email_from で受信箱グルーピングするため)。new-empty-table exception is not applicable;
# CONCURRENTLY cannot run inside Supabase's per-file transaction. Bounded one-time write
# lock, accepted at ship time. Rationale: docs/operations/zero-downtime-migrations.md.
20260708000001_customer_messages_email_from.sql

